  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It is currently possible to add tags to your world uploads in order to help people search for them. However, the system can be greatly improved by using an interactive tag system within the SDK.\nFirst, allow users to select commonly used tags upon clicking into the textbox (setting it to an \"active\" state). This would show the most popularly used tags and a number next to it corresponding to how many worlds it's currently applied to {i.e, \"Anime (4128)\"}. This will help prevent multiple variations of existing tags and greatly improve search results in-game. Second, as the user types in a tag name, have it give suggestions of existing tags that match. Lastly, if the user enters a tag name that doesn't exist, allow the user to attach it and add it to the tag database upon world upload.",
